    w-neighborhood>=1.45 — no isolated spike, chosen cell NOT peak, PASS
 c) halves H1=1.69 H2=1.35 (>=0.3) PASS
 d) 2 negative years in 37 (2018 -1.5%, 2022 -2.8%), both > -5% PASS
